<!--
  Anonymized Traktor Pro 4 export used by the S3 parser tests.

  Derived from a real `NML VERSION="20"` export, then sanitized: every absolute
  path is synthetic (`/:Users/:dj/...`). It keeps the format quirks the parser
  must honor — GRID nested inside a TYPE="4" cue, a grid cue named "Beat Marker"
  instead of "AutoGrid", a 0-based HOTCUE, a loop with LEN > 0, an entry with
  TEMPO but no grid, an entry with neither TEMPO nor MUSICAL_KEY, Open Key /
  Camelot / note-name INFO KEY values, XML entities and a typographic apostrophe
  in FILE names, a nested FOLDER, a SMARTLIST with SEARCH_EXPRESSION, and
  PRIMARYKEY playlist references (one of which intentionally does not resolve).
-->
